@startuml Git Hooks Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Git Hooks Architecture - AI Use Case CLI

actor Developer
participant "setup-project.sh" as Setup
database "git-hooks/\n(templates)" as Templates
database ".git/hooks/\n(active hooks)" as GitHooks
database ".claude/hooks/\n(Claude Code)" as ClaudeHooks
participant "git commit" as GitCommit
participant "pre-commit hook" as PreCommit
participant "post-commit hook" as PostCommit
participant "Git Status" as GitStatus
participant "sync script" as SyncScript
database "Use Case Hub" as Hub
participant "Claude Code Session" as Session
participant "SessionEnd hook" as SessionEnd
database ".usecase/session-stats/\nYYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS.txt" as Stats

== Installation Phase ==

Developer -> Setup: Run setup script
activate Setup
Setup -> Templates: Read hook templates
Setup -> GitHooks: Copy pre-commit
Setup -> GitHooks: Copy post-commit
Setup -> GitHooks: Set executable (chmod +x)
Setup -> ClaudeHooks: Copy SessionEnd hook
Setup -> Setup: Create .usecase/session-stats/
Setup --> Developer: Hooks installed ✓
deactivate Setup

note right of Templates
  **Hook Templates Location:**
  • git-hooks/pre-commit
  • git-hooks/post-commit
  • claude-hooks/SessionEnd
end note

== Git Workflow: Pre-Commit Hook (Branch Protection) ==

Developer -> GitCommit: git commit -m "message"
activate GitCommit
GitCommit -> PreCommit: Execute before commit
activate PreCommit

alt Current branch is main or master
  PreCommit -> PreCommit: Check branch name
  PreCommit --> GitCommit: ❌ REJECT commit
  GitCommit --> Developer: Error: Direct commits\nto protected branches\nnot allowed
else On feature/fix/docs branch
  PreCommit -> PreCommit: ✓ Branch check passed
  PreCommit --> GitCommit: ✓ ALLOW commit
  deactivate PreCommit

  == Git Workflow: Post-Commit Hook (Auto-Sync) ==

  GitCommit -> GitCommit: Create commit
  GitCommit -> PostCommit: Execute after commit
  activate PostCommit
  PostCommit -> GitStatus: Get changed files
  GitStatus --> PostCommit: List of modified files

  alt Files in .usecase/cases/ changed
    PostCommit -> PostCommit: Detect AI use case changes
    PostCommit -> SyncScript: Run sync-ai-use-cases.sh
    activate SyncScript
    SyncScript -> Hub: Sync documentation
    Hub --> SyncScript: Sync complete
    SyncScript --> PostCommit: ✓ Success
    deactivate SyncScript
    PostCommit --> GitCommit: Commit completed with sync
  else No use case changes
    PostCommit --> GitCommit: Commit completed (no sync)
  end
  deactivate PostCommit
  GitCommit --> Developer: Commit successful ✓
end
deactivate GitCommit

note right of PreCommit
  **Branch Protection Rules:**
  ✓ Allowed: feature/*, fix/*,
            docs/*, refactor/*,
            test/*
  ❌ Blocked: main, master

  **Bypass:**
  git commit --no-verify
end note

note right of PostCommit
  **Sync Configuration:**
  • AI_USECASES_SYNC_SCRIPT env
  • AI_USECASES_DIR env
  • Default: ~/Documents/
    ai-use-case-hub/
    sync-ai-use-cases.sh

  **Non-blocking:**
  Sync failures don't prevent commits
end note

== Claude Code Integration: SessionEnd Hook ==

Developer -> Session: End Claude Code session
activate Session
Session -> SessionEnd: Trigger SessionEnd hook
activate SessionEnd
SessionEnd -> SessionEnd: Capture session metadata
SessionEnd -> SessionEnd: Get recent commits\n(last 2 hours)
SessionEnd -> SessionEnd: Check uncommitted changes
SessionEnd -> Stats: Write statistics file
Stats --> SessionEnd: File created
SessionEnd --> Session: Hook complete
deactivate SessionEnd
Session --> Developer: Session ended\nStats saved ✓
deactivate Session

note right of SessionEnd
  **Statistics Captured:**
  • Session end timestamp
  • Current branch & repository
  • Recent commits (2h window)
  • Uncommitted changes
  • Token usage (via /cost)
end note

@enduml
